            <profile id="5527-9010-e049-d099" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All have a hand weapon, light armour, composite bow and shield. Eastern Shock Cavalry. Guards may have heavy armour (+1), thrusting spear (+3) and cloth barding (+3). They are Veteran and may be Stubborn (+3).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="a20d-6317-b9b9-0c09" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
