            </profile>
            <profile id="618e-acd5-553e-74c5" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mahouts have light armour. The 2 crew have a hand weapon, light armour and composite bow or javelins. They fight from a howdah, adding +2 to their armour save. An additional crewman can be purchased (+12). Khwarismian elephants do not appear to have been barded, but carried two distinctive large round metal shields to protect the beasts’ vulnerable ears. To reflect this, they may purchase half- barding for +6 points, adding +1 to their armour save from the front only.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="6d4e-794c-1cd6-8a20" name="Light Armour" hidden="false" targetId="e1d7-1cd3-1431-4862" type="profile"/>
